  "bookId": "EPH",
  "bookName": "Ephesians",
  "chapterNumber": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:1",
      "text": "Paul here—an apostle of Christ Jesus by God's will, writing to God's holy people in Ephesus, the faithful in Christ Jesus:"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:2",
      "text": "Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. 🕊️"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:3",
      "text": "Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ! In Christ, God has blessed us with every spiritual blessing from heaven. 🙌"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:4",
      "text": "Before the world even began, he chose us in Christ to be holy and blameless before him, living in love."
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:5",
      "text": "God had already planned to welcome us as his children through Jesus Christ. That was what he wanted, and it brought him joy."
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:6",
      "text": "So praise the glory of his grace! He freely welcomed us in the One he loves. ✨"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:7",
      "text": "In Christ, his blood bought our freedom; our wrongs are forgiven. That's grace overflowing,"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:8",
      "text": "grace he poured out on us in full measure, with all wisdom and understanding."
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:9",
      "text": "He let us in on the mystery of his plan—the purpose he was pleased to set in motion through Christ—"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:10",
      "text": "so when the right time arrived, everything in heaven and on earth would be brought together under Christ."
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:11",
      "text": "In Christ, we were also given an inheritance, chosen ahead of time according to God's plan. He works everyt…17 tokens truncated…: 12,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:12",
      "text": "so that we—who first put our hope in Christ—would live to praise his glory."
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:13",
      "text": "And you too, when you heard the true message, the Good News that rescues you, and trusted Christ, were marked with the promised Holy Spirit. 🔒"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:14",
      "text": "The Spirit is the down payment on our inheritance, until God fully claims what belongs to him—all to praise his glory."
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:15",
      "text": "That's why, after hearing about your faith in the Lord Jesus and your love for all God's people,"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:16",
      "text": "I never stop thanking God for you; I keep bringing you up in my prayers. 🙏"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:17",
      "text": "I ask the God of our Lord Jesus Christ, the glorious Father, to give you wisdom and revelation as you know him more deeply."
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:18",
      "text": "May the eyes of your heart light up, so you can grasp the hope he called you to, the rich glory of his inheritance among his people,"
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:19",
      "text": "and the incredible greatness of his power toward us who believe—the same strength and might he puts to work,"
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:20",
      "text": "the power he showed in Christ when he raised him from the dead and seated him at his right hand in heaven,"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:21",
      "text": "far above every ruler, authority, power, and dominion, and every name anyone can name—not just now, but in the age to come too."
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:22",
      "text": "God put everything under Christ's feet and made him head over everything for the church,"
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "sourceRef": "eng-web:EPH:1:23",
      "text": "which is Christ's body, filled by him—the One who fills everything, everywhere."
    }
  ]
}
